<DocsLayout title="Contributing" kicker="22 / project" description="A small contribution path for a personal, pre-1.0 open-source project.">
  <h2>Local setup</h2>
  <pre><code>python -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate
python -m pip install -e ".[dev]"
pytest
ruff check reachq tests scripts
mypy reachq</code></pre>
  <h2>Before opening a pull request</h2>
  <p>Add tests for behavior changes, update the relevant user or research documentation, and add a changelog entry for public behavior changes. Keep the public top-level API deliberate; experimental work belongs under <code>reachq.research</code> or an explicitly marked optional backend.</p>
  <p>Read the repository <a href="https://github.com/sachncs/reachq/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">contribution guide ↗</a> for the full workflow.</p>
</DocsLayout>
